title: unsorted folder > queue
pid: 3e202da4-7c6b-4790-9097-54a3cc110502
body: |2-
  Keeping an unsorted folder in each node
  is better than
  making each node a queue.

  An unsorted bucket at the top of the queue
  dispels the danger of not finding your way back,
  but maybe increases the risk of being stuck there
  beyond what simple insertion (at the top, bc it's a queue) would do.
contains:
